uvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ww3YJXu5c18aGZXWmm00qg","review_id":"KdPM8JgP8hOGo13KLng4bg","date":"2015-05-03T23:41:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9529179334640503,"text_excerpt":"We had dinner at Cafe Amelie just after arriving in NOLA last week, and we were impressed! We sat in the courtyard area, which is in a beautiful garden and not overly crowded or noisy. Drinks were solid, and the food was fine - I had seafood pasta, which wasn't anything over-the-top, but was exactly what it advertised: crawfish, shrimp, scallops in penne. The pistachio cake for dessert was a Wife Pick, but I was really impressed. Our server was friendly, quick, and attentive. It's a place where you're slightly over-paying for the beautiful surroundings, but it's a staple in the French Quarter. I do slightly wish we would have gotten to stop for brunch, but our dinner was lovely!"},{"business_id":"ww3YJXu5c18aGZXWmm00qg","review_id":"5vTuJZQUAi7ZUw8_1F_8aw","date":"2018-06-02T22:27:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9524945020675659,"text_excerpt":"I loved eating here. We came by on a windy overcast night, but despite the wind, dining outside was a pleasure. We sat in the courtyard, which was incredibly cute! Heat lamps when it's chilly, hanging lights, cute little fountain and lovely large trees. We sat a bit off to the side, so didn't feel like we were sharing the space with anyone else. Service was great. Quickly served us drinks and took our orders. A friend of mine told me Cafe Amelie served the best shrimp and grits she's ever had. She was right! Hearty portions of shrimp, perfectly cooked grits and just an amazing flavor explosion! For our first main, we had the citrus roast chicken with mashed potatoes and asparagus. Perfect..."},{"business_id":"ww3YJXu5c18aGZXWmm00qg","review_id":"44FF_Y8xYKA3N1ozthywHQ","date":"2021-03-09T12:21:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.945106029510498,"text_excerpt":"We recently had a limited time in Nawlins and it's always a dilemma to try to pick and choose the best spots to eat and visit. This trip was to bring my honey to the train station but also to grab an afternoon and evening for ourselves before she left for New England to help out a friend post-surgery. This time for dinner I got some excellent advise from a real Nola guru and Yelp friend Shannon S. He recommended this gem of a date night spot that indeed was spot on for ambience, service and food, nicely done Shannon! On this Saturday I called for a reservation but they were all booked up but were welcoming walk-ins so we took our chances and headed out for an early dinner. We were fortuna..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ww3YJXu5c18aGZXWmm00qg","photo_id":"km_N91ssMRMFJXux8DrdBQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/km_N91ssMRMFJXux8DrdBQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8990450501441956},{"business_id":"ww3YJXu5c18aGZXWmm00qg","photo_id":"iC-mp7Mc88OAc_PgHj1Rng","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/iC-mp7Mc88OAc_PgHj1Rng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8663954734802246},{"business_id":"ww3YJXu5c18aGZXWmm00qg","photo_id":"TXU1MOmzz5YrbK6uwWTcTA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/TXU1MOmzz5YrbK6uwWTcTA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8526272773742676},{"business_id":"ww3YJXu5c18aGZXWmm00qg","photo_id":"UHXWRNLwxC45j1R-8yZE